\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces KaryoFlow from image to detections. A real metaphase image and its dense crop show four-NFE box refinement and the final ranked detections. The lower row makes one normalized center-and-scale trajectory explicit and exposes an actual detector evaluation: multi-scale RoIAlign, self-attention, DynamicConv, feed-forward refinement, AdaLN-Zero time conditioning, six cascade heads, and the final-head quality branch. Endpoints and output boxes are empirical; intermediate boxes visualize the prescribed linear RF path rather than recorded hidden activations. Vector overlays remain editable while microscopy panels retain the source pixels.}}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:method_overview}{{1}{3}{}{}{}}
